        "requirementsText": "Using synthetic accounts only, verify passwordless email login in the local VeriQA demo.\nOnly valid email addresses ending exactly with @e.ntu.edu.sg are accepted; reject other domains and spoofed suffixes.\nA correct mock OTP creates a server-recognised session. Delivery is local and no real email is sent.\nUnauthenticated users must not receive protected home data.\nOn home, show a welcome message with the email and a tiny checklist. Toggling a task must survive refresh.\nLogout invalidates the server session. Propose up to three focused cases supported by the current action schema.\n",
        "reviewNotes": [
          "Requirement 5 expects two tasks but demo tasks accessed via review-requirements checkbox only; verified one due to demo schema constraints.",
          "No explicit negative tests covering incorrect OTP attempts as unsupported by current action schema.",
          "No direct coverage of OTP expiry or session timeout due to lack of timing controls in demo."
        ],
